e="19"><CHAR>우 수 상</CHAR></TEXT></P></PARALIST></CELL><CELL BorderFill="53" ColAddr="1" ColSpan="1" Dirty="false" Editable="false" HasMargin="false" Header="false" Height="2148" Protect="false" RowAddr="4" RowSpan="1" Width="4524"><CELLMARGIN Bottom="141" Left="141" Right="141" Top="141"/><PARALIST LineWrap="Break" LinkListID="0" LinkListIDNext="0" TextDirection="0" VertAlign="Center"><P ParaShape="42" Style="0"><TEXT CharShape="19"><CHAR>2</CHAR></TEXT></P></PARALIST></CELL><CELL BorderFill="53" ColAddr="2" ColSpan="1" Dirty="false" Editable="false" HasMargin="false" Header="false" Height="2148" Protect="false" RowAddr="4" RowSpan="1" Width="21787"><CELLMARGIN Bottom="141" Left="141" Right="141" Top="141"/><PARALIST LineWrap="Break" LinkListID="0" LinkListIDNext="0" TextDirection="0" VertAlign="Center"><P ParaShape="42" Style="0"><TEXT CharShape="19"><CHAR>상장 및 시상금 각 100만원</CHAR></TEXT></P></PARALIST></CELL><CELL BorderFill="55" ColAddr="3" ColSpan="1" Dirty="false" Editable="false" HasMargin="false" Header="false" Height="2148" Protect="false" RowAddr="4" RowSpan="1" Width="12354"><CELLMARGIN Bottom="141" Left="141" Right="141" Top="141"/><PARALIST LineWrap="Break" LinkListID="0" LinkListIDNext="0" TextDirection="0" VertAlign="Center"><P ParaShape="42" Style="0"><TEXT CharShape="66"><CHAR>부산상공회의소 회장</CHAR></TEXT></P></PARALIST></CELL></ROW><ROW><CELL BorderFill="50" ColAddr="0" ColSpan="1" Dirty="false" Editable="false" HasMargin="false" Header="false" Height="4100" Protect="false" RowAddr="5" RowSpan="1" Width="9614"><CELLMARGIN Bottom="141" Left="141" Right="141" Top="141"/><PARALIST LineWrap="Break" LinkListID="0" LinkListIDNext="0" TextDirection="0" VertAlign="Center"><P ParaShape="41" Style="0"><TEXT CharShape="19"><CHAR>장 려 상</CHAR></TEXT></P></PARALIST></CELL><CELL BorderFill="52" ColAddr="1" ColSpan="1" Dirty="false" Editable="false" HasMargin="false" Header="false" Height="4100" Protect="false" RowAddr="5" RowSpan="1" Width="4524"><CELLMARGIN Bottom="141" Left="141" Right="141" Top="141"/><PARALIST LineWrap="Break" LinkListID="0" LinkListIDNext="0" TextDirection="0" VertAlign="Center"><P ParaShape="42" Style="0"><TEXT CharShape="19"><CHAR>3</CHAR></TEXT></P></PARALIST></CELL><CELL BorderFill="52" ColAddr="2" ColSpan="1" Dirty="false" Editable="false" HasMargin="false" Header="false" Height="4100" Protect="false" RowAddr="5" RowSpan="1" Width="21787"><CELLMARGIN Bottom="141" Left="141" Right="141" Top="141"/><PARALIST LineWrap="Break" LinkListID="0" LinkListIDNext="0" TextDirection="0" VertAlign="Center"><P ParaShape="42" Style="0"><TEXT CharShape="19"><CHAR>상장 및 시상금 각  50만원</CHAR></TEXT></P></PARALIST></CELL><CELL BorderFill="54" ColAddr="3" ColSpan="1" Dirty="false" Editable="false" HasMargin="false" Header="false" Height="4100" Protect="false" RowAddr="5" RowSpan="1" Width="12354"><CELLMARGIN Bottom="141" Left="141" Right="141" Top="141"/><PARALIST LineWrap="Break" LinkListID="0" LinkListIDNext="0" TextDirection="0" VertAlign="Center"><P ParaShape="42" Style="0"><TEXT CharShape="19"><CHAR>부산연구원장</CHAR></TEXT></P></PARALIST></CELL></ROW></TABLE><CHAR/></TEXT></P><P ParaShape="36" Style="0"><TEXT CharShape="65"/></P><P ParaShape="36" Style="0"><TEXT CharShape="20"><TABLE BorderFill="6" CellSpacing="0" ColCount="3" PageBreak="Cell" RepeatHeader="true" RowCount="1"><SHAPEOBJECT InstId="1575328823" Lock="false" NumberingType="Table" ZOrder="10"><SIZE Height="2648" HeightRelTo="Absolute" Protect="false" Width="12019" WidthRelTo="Absolute"/><POSITION AffectLSpacing="false" AllowOverlap="false" FlowWithText="true" HoldAnchorAndSO="false" HorzAlign="Left" HorzOffset="0" HorzRelTo="Para" TreatAsChar="true" VertAlign="Top" VertOffset="0" VertRelTo="Para"/><OUTSIDEMARGIN Bottom="141" Left="141" Right="141" Top="141"/></SHAPEOBJECT><INSIDEMARGIN Bottom="141" Left="141" Right="141" Top="141"/><ROW><CELL BorderFill="56" ColAddr="0" ColSpan="1" Dirty="false" Editable="false" HasMargin="false" Header="false" Height="2648" Protect="false" RowAddr="0" RowSpan="1" Width="3063"><CELLMARGIN Bottom="141" Left="141" Right="141" Top="141"/><PARALIST LineWrap="Break" LinkListID="0" LinkListIDNext="0" TextDirection="0" VertAlign="Center"><P ParaShape="37" Style="0"><TEXT CharShape="22"><CHAR>3</CHAR></TEXT></P></PARALIST></CELL><CELL BorderFill="7" ColAddr="1" ColSpan="1" Dirty="false" Editable="false" HasMargin="false" Header="false" Height="2648" Protect="false" RowAddr="0" RowSpan="1" Width="565"><CELLMARGIN Bottom="141" Left="141" Right="141" Top="141"/><PARALIST LineWrap="Break" LinkListID="0" LinkListIDNext="0" TextDirection="0" VertAlign="Center"><P ParaShape="38" Style="0"><TEXT CharShape="23"/></P></PARALIST></CELL><CELL BorderFill="8" ColAddr="2" ColSpan="1" Dirty="false" Editable="false" HasMargin="false" Header="false" Height="2648" Protect="false" RowAddr="0" RowSpan="1" Width="8391"><CELLMARGIN Bottom="141" Left="141" Right="141" Top="141"/><PARALIST LineWrap="Break" LinkListID="0" LinkListIDNext="0" TextDirection="0" VertAlign="Center"><P ParaShape="38" Style="0"><TEXT CharShape="24"><CHAR> 유의사항</CHAR></TEXT></P></PARALIST></CELL></ROW></TABLE><CHAR/></TEXT></P><P ParaShape="36" Style="0"><TEXT CharShape="64"/></P><P ParaShape="39" Style="0"><TEXT CharShape="68"><CHAR> ㅇ 저작재산권 관련</CHAR></TEXT></P><P ParaShape="58" Style="0"><TEXT CharShape="68"><CHAR>  - 제출한 결과물의 저작재산권은 주최측에 있으며 대회의 취지, <LINEBREAK/>공익적 목적에 한해 글로벌허브도시 부산과 연관된 정책 및 <LINEBREAK/>사업 등으로 활용될 수 있음.</CHAR></TEXT></P><P ParaShape="39" Style="0"><TEXT CharShape="62"/></P><P ParaShape="39" Style="0"><TEXT CharShape="68"><CHAR> ㅇ 기타 유의사항</CHAR></TEXT></P><P ParaShape="58" Style="0"><TEXT CharShape="68"><CHAR>  - 대회는 상황에 따라 일정, 내용 등이 변경될 수 있으며, 변경된 사항은 <LINEBREAK/></CHAR></TEXT><TEXT CharShape="70"><CHAR>부산광역시 홈페이지를 통해 공지하며 이를 확인하지 못해 생기는 불이익은</CHAR></TEXT><TEXT CharShape="68"><CHAR> 참가자에게 있음</CHAR></TEXT></P><P ParaShape="57" Style="0"><TEXT CharShape="68"><CHAR> - </CHAR></TEXT><TEXT CharShape="69"><CHAR>다음의 결격사유가 있는 경우 심사 제외되며, 수상 후에 밝혀진 경우에도</CHAR></TEXT><TEXT CharShape="68"><CHAR> <LINEBREAK/>수상이 취소되며 상장 및 상금은 반환함</CHAR></TEXT></P><P ParaShape="39" Style="0"><TEXT CharShape="68"><CHAR>   1) 국내외 타 공모전 및 대회에서 수상한 경우</CHAR></TEXT></P><P ParaShape="39" Style="0"><TEXT CharShape="68"><CHAR>   2) 모방 및 표절로 인정되는 경우</CHAR></TEXT></P><P ParaShape="57" Style="0"><TEXT CharShape="68"><CHAR> - 접수 마감일에 과부하로 인한 전산 오류 등을 감안하여 <LINEBREAK/>사전에 접수하도록 하며, 이에 따른 모든 책임은 참가자에게 있음</CHAR></TEXT></P><P ParaShape="39" Style="0"><TEXT CharShape="68"><CHAR> - 접수서류 제출 이후, 개인적인 사정으로 인한 팀원 변경은 불가함</CHAR></TEXT></P><P ParaShape="57" Style="0"><TEXT CharShape="68"><CHAR> - 기타 궁금한 사항은 「제2회 부산 글로벌허브도시 청년 해커톤 대회」 <LINEBREAK/>운영사무국(☎051-714-4674)으로 문의하시기 바랍니다.</CHAR></TEXT></P></SECTION></BODY><TAIL><SCRIPTCODE Type="JScript" Version="1.0"><SCRIPTHEADER></SCRIPTHEADER><SCRIPTSOURCE></SCRIPTSOURCE></SCRIPTCODE></TAIL></HWPML>